  "body": "<details>\r\n\r\n<summary><h2>Installation and signature verification</h2></summary>\r\n\r\n### Installation\r\n\r\n#### By downloading binary from the release\r\n\r\nFor instance, if you are using Linux on an AMD64 architecture:\r\n```shell\r\n# Download the binary\r\ncurl -LO https://github.com/carvel-dev/kapp/releases/download/v0.66.1/kapp-linux-amd64\r\n\r\n# Move the binary in to your PATH\r\nmv kapp-linux-amd64 /usr/local/bin/kapp\r\n\r\n# Make the binary executable\r\nchmod +x /usr/local/bin/kapp\r\n```\r\n\r\n#### Via Homebrew (macOS or Linux)\r\n```shell\r\n$ brew tap carvel-dev/carvel\r\n$ brew install kapp\r\n$ kapp version  \r\n```\r\n\r\n### Verify checksums file signature\r\n\r\nThe checksums file provided within the artifacts attached to this release is signed using [Cosign](https://docs.sigstore.dev/cosign/overview/) with GitHub OIDC(Refer [this](https://docs.sigstore.dev/system_config/installation/) page for cosign installation). To validate the signature of this file, run the following commands:\r\n\r\n```shell\r\n# Download the checksums file, certificate and signature\r\ncurl -LO https://github.com/carvel-dev/kapp/releases/download/v0.66.1/checksums.txt\r\ncurl -LO https://github.com/carvel-dev/kapp/releases/download/v0.66.1/checksums.txt.pem\r\ncurl -LO https://github.com/carvel-dev/kapp/releases/download/v0.66.1/checksums.txt.sig\r\n\r\n# Verify the checksums file\r\ncosign verify-blob checksums.txt \\\r\n  --certificate checksums.txt.pem \\\r\n  --signature checksums.txt.sig \\\r\n  --certificate-identity-regexp=https://github.com/carvel-dev \\\r\n  --certificate-oidc-issuer=https://token.actions.githubusercontent.com\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Verify binary integrity\r\n\r\nTo verify the integrity of the downloaded binary, you can utilize the checksums file after having validated its signature.\r\n```shell\r\n# Verify the binary using the checksums file\r\nsha256sum -c checksums.txt --ignore-missing\r\n```\r\n</details>\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* feat: add deployment flag for printing out the graph of resources by @erikmiller-gusto in https://github.com/carvel-dev/kapp/pull/1064\r\n* Migrate ytt dependency to carvel.dev/ytt by @Siegfriedk in https://github.com/carvel-dev/kapp/pull/1102\r\n* Bump golang 1.25.6 by @CodesbyUnnati in https://github.com/carvel-dev/kapp/pull/1107\r\n* Bump k8s to 1.35 to fix CVEs by @CodesbyUnnati in https://github.com/carvel-dev/kapp/pull/1108\r\n* Replace hardcoded shebangs with /usr/bin/env for portability by @Lillecarl in https://github.com/carvel-dev/kapp/pull/1105\r\n* Bump k8s.io/apimachinery from 0.35.0 to 0.35.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/carvel-dev/kapp/pull/1113\r\n* Bump k8s.io/apiextensions-apiserver from 0.35.0 to 0.35.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/carvel-dev/kapp/pull/1112\r\n* Bump k8s.io/kubernetes from 1.35.0 to 1.35.1 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/carvel-dev/kapp/pull/1111\r\n* Bump github.com/hashicorp/go-version to v1.7.0 by @G-Gobi in https://github.com/carvel-dev/kapp/pull/1128\r\n* Fix long CRD change group validation by @guettli in https://github.com/carvel-dev/kapp/pull/1124\r\n* Retrieve the latest kindest/node image for tests by @joaopapereira in https://github.com/carvel-dev/kapp/pull/1120\r\n* Return an error instead of panicking on a non-map array element by @arpitjain099 in https://github.com/carvel-dev/kapp/pull/1132\r\n* Bump golang.org/x/net from 0.47.0 to 0.50.0 by @dependabot[bot] in https://github.com/carvel-dev/kapp/pull/1115\r\n* Migrate kapp-controller dependency to carvel.dev/kapp-controller by @Siegfriedk in https://github.com/carvel-dev/kapp/pull/1121\r\n* bump go to 1.27 by @AshishNaware in https://github.com/carvel-dev/kapp/pull/1138\r\n* Bump dependencies by @praveenrewar in https://github.com/carvel-dev/kapp/pull/1139\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @erikmiller-gusto made their first contribution in https://github.com/carvel-dev/kapp/pull/1064\r\n* @Siegfriedk made their first contribution in https://github.com/carvel-dev/kapp/pull/1102\r\n* @Lillecarl made their first contribution in https://github.com/carvel-dev/kapp/pull/1105\r\n* @G-Gobi made their first contribution in https://github.com/carvel-dev/kapp/pull/1128\r\n* @guettli made their first contribution in https://github.com/carvel-dev/kapp/pull/1124\r\n* @arpitjain099 made their first contribution in https://github.com/carvel-dev/kapp/pull/1132\r\n* @AshishNaware made their first contribution in https://github.com/carvel-dev/kapp/pull/1138\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/carvel-dev/kapp/compare/v0.65.4...v0.66.1\r\n\r\n## :open_file_folder: Files Checksum\r\n\r\n```\r\n07d8bca1556e0cb3355a82f11a4a1aadfd676795ee407b30f4c99d3d0594e963  ./kapp-darwin-amd64\r\n42a508769f0c3d2bef48c5d82028d5ad41632fdea10bafb348a16d12ca23c613  ./kapp-darwin-arm64\r\naf3a5051fdaacc477528f288a45516811bcc8b35c67ba68c04c95a7543daba2e  ./kapp-linux-amd64\r\nd64989caa229a3427376de44bf2e739e4631a21f69d2968758d01c903c004fe0  ./kapp-linux-arm64\r\nc7d7f99ed4691996a73e08fd803bd4626ca3d1bb6623fe4971e9964aa75ae4c9  ./kapp-windows-amd64.exe\r\n```",
